==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|incessant}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/ɪnˈsɛs.ənt/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-incessant.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Without [[pause]] or [[stop]]; not [[ending]], especially to the point of annoyance.
#: ''The dog's '''incessant''' barking kept the girl awake all night.''

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|unremitting}}
* {{l|en|continuous}}
* {{l|en|unceasing}}

